 us -sometimes for the best and sometimes for the worst. The show centers around fifteen-year-old Jenna Hamilton, who, like many, feels invisible to her peers and desperately wants to find her place--which is hard to do in a day and age where fitting in means standing out. Unfortunately, Jenna's visibility comes on the heels of an accident that gives her a not-so-fun stigma. And while the stigma of her accident could be the curse of her life, Jenna's determined to make it her life's blessing.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.6}],"value":7.6,"age":"pg-13"},"current_season_id":7829,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}